From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:20:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 55/57] Synchronized views also scroll two Markdown previews
 together

With "Synchronize vertical scrolling" on and both views showing a Markdown
preview, scrolling one preview now scrolls the other to the same fraction
of its height. The follower's own scroll event does not echo back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

